        "original_id": "265def1b-c4c2-5b5b-a8e0-f99011db44a0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Super Furry Animals, Social Distortion\n- People: Gruff Rhys, Huw Bunford, Guto Pryce, Cian Ciaran, Dafydd Ieuan, Mike Ness, Jonny Wickersham, Brent Harding, David Hidalgo Jr., David Kalish\n- Products: \"Bing Bong\"\n- Places: Cardiff, Wales\n\nFacts:\n- Super Furry Animals formed in Cardiff, Wales in 1993.\n- Since 1993, Super Furry Animals has consisted of Gruff Rhys, Huw Bunford, Guto Pryce, Cian Ciaran, and Dafydd Ieuan.\n- Gruff Rhys performs lead vocals and guitar for Super Furry Animals.\n- Huw Bunford performs lead guitar and vocals for Super Furry Animals.\n- Guto Pryce plays bass guitar for Super Furry Animals.\n- Cian Ciaran plays keyboards, synthesisers, and various electronics, and also contributes occasional guitar and vocals for Super Furry Animals.\n- Dafydd Ieuan plays drums and contributes vocals for Super Furry Animals.\n- \"Bing Bong\" is a single by Super Furry Animals that was released on 13 May 2016.\n- Social Distortion currently consists of Mike Ness, Jonny Wickersham, Brent Harding, David Hidalgo Jr., and David Kalish.\n- Mike Ness performs lead vocals and lead guitar for Social Distortion.\n- Jonny Wickersham plays rhythm guitar and provides backing vocals for Social Distortion.\n- Brent Harding plays bass and provides backing vocals for Social Distortion.\n- David Hidalgo Jr. plays drums for Social Distortion.\n- David Kalish plays keyboards for Social Distortion.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "3bb21cc4-80c9-5f2b-b202-e9b08cede4a0",
        "text": "Page: Super Furry Animals. Sentence: Since their formation in Cardiff, Wales in 1993, the band has consisted of Gruff Rhys (lead vocals, guitar), Huw Bunford (lead guitar, vocals), Guto Pryce (bass guitar), Cian Ciaran (keyboards, synthesisers, various electronics, occasional guitar, vocals) and Dafydd Ieuan (drums, vocals).\nPage: Social Distortion. Sentence: The band currently consists of Mike Ness (lead vocals, lead guitar), Jonny Wickersham (rhythm guitar, backing vocals), Brent Harding (bass, backing vocals), David Hidalgo Jr. (drums), and David Kalish (keyboards).\nPage: Bing Bong. Sentence: \"Bing Bong\" is a single by the Super Furry Animals, released on 13 May 2016.",
